<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hanbo creditors reject POSCO proposal.</title>
<headline>Hanbo creditors reject POSCO proposal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Creditors of South Korea's Hanbo Steel Co  have rejected a proposal by Pohang Iron and Steel Co to buy the failed  steelmaker's fixed assets, creditors said on Friday.</p>
</text>
